PUZZLE

You must guide all chus into a rocket to complete each puzzle.
If a chu dies or a kapu enters a rocket you lose.
Chus can die by being eaten by a kapu or falling into a hole.
You have a set amount of arrows - these are displayed at the bottom of the screen.
Place all your arrows, then click GO and watch the puzzle progress.
If you fail the puzzle, the area where it went wrong is highlighted.

{2}Buttons: {1}
GO		- begin puzzle
FFWD	- speed up puzzle playback
REDO	- restart puzzle
EXIT	- back to menu
